      "description": "I love creating new casserole dishes. Besides having to chop up your vegetables, this is an easy one pan keto dinner and is very filling!\n\nI made this with a ground beef base with vegetables and seasonings that pair just right and some beef broth to bring all the ingredients together. Of course, I topped it off the best way I know how – with mozzarella cheese and let it bake in the oven until the cheese was just melted!\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n2 tablespoon olive oil\n24 ounce ground beef\n1 medium red onion\n2 teaspoon fresh garlic, minced\n1 teaspoon paprika\n1 medium red bell pepper, diced\n14 ounce canned diced tomatoes\n1 tablespoon soy sauce\n1 tablespoon tomato paste\n2 whole bay leaf\n6 ounce spinach\n3 tablespoon fresh parsley, chopped plus extra to serve\nSalt and pepper to taste\n2 cup beef broth\n1 teaspoon dried oregano\n7 ounce mozzarella cheese\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 6 servings of Keto Cheesy Beef and Spinach Casserole. Each serving comes out to be 479 calories, 35.5g fat, 5.4g net carbs, and 31.3g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
